# No Cursor in credits

Never list Cursor (IDE, company, agents, Autopilot) in README, MARKETING, ABOUT, sponsors, supporters, acknowledgements, thanks, credits, "built with", badges, footers, or Padros family / ecosystem lists — any language.

Build tools are not product supporters. Omit Cursor from tool credits unless the user explicitly asks to name Cursor.
